Data and services Flipparr can use, each under its own terms, which the
operator accepts when enabling it. Flipparr ships none of their data and is
not affiliated with or endorsed by any of them; the app credits each one in
Settings -> About and beside the data it shows.

  Grand Comics Database (www.comics.org)
      Data from the Grand Comics Database(TM), licensed under the Creative
      Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International licence
      (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/).
  Metron (metron.cloud)        its API terms; the operator's account
  Comic Vine                   its API terms: non-commercial use, a link back
                               on every page using its data; the operator's key
  Open Library                 Internet Archive terms; covers API not crawled
  Google Books                 Google's API terms and branding ("Powered by
                               Google" beside its results); the operator's key
  Anthropic, OpenAI            optional vision models, on the operator's key
  Community reading lists      fetched from their authors' GitHub repository
                               (DieselTech/CBL-ReadingLists) when turned on and
                               chosen; none are shipped

What leaves the server, and when, is in docs/PRIVACY.md.
